                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "For 60 years, Medicare and Medicaid have been a promise to our communities\u2014a commitment that no one should go without the health care they need.\u2028\u00a0\n\nBut today, the Big, Ugly Bill threatens to break that promise. Over 17 million people could lose their coverage, and health care costs will skyrocket.\u2028\u00a0\n\nOn this Medicaid and Medicare Matters Day of Action, @HouseDemocrats are standing up to protect these vital programs.",
