                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From May 2021 to 2023, Texas home insurance premiums jumped 46%. Floods, freezes, and extreme heat are driving insurers out, leaving families and businesses to shoulder the cost.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nIt\u2019s time for action: fortified roofs, energy-efficient buildings, reformed FEMA flood insurance, and more.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nProud to join @SenWhitehouse in Kashmere Gardens to demand action.",
