                "text": "Republicans are letting the Affordable Care Act credits expire, raising health care premiums by 93% for 24 million Americans. That means parents will have to choose between paying for necessities or taking their sick kid to the doctor. Working families can\u2019t afford these cruel policies \u2014 and Republicans just don\u2019t care.\n\n@HouseDemocrats @HouseDPCC @RepMcGovern",
