                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Republicans just rammed through a partisan spending bill that escalates their assault on affordable health care. By letting the ACA credits expire, they\u2019re jacking up premiums by 93% for 24 million Americans.\n\nParents will be forced to choose between putting food on the table or taking a sick child to the doctor.\n\nI stood with @HouseDemocrats and voted NO. Working families can\u2019t afford these cruel policies.\n\n@HouseDPCC @RepJeffries",
