                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Government funding runs out in just 5 days, and Trump and MAGA Republicans are steering us toward a shutdown and health care crisis. If the Affordable Care Act tax credits expire, 111,000 people in TX-29 will see their premiums skyrocket. 48,400 will lose coverage. We must act now to save health care and keep the government open.\n\n@HouseDemocrats",
