                "text": "I\u2019m back in DC fighting to stop Donald Trump and Republicans from shutting down the government and letting ACA tax credits expire. If they succeed, premiums will skyrocket for millions \u2014 including 111,000 people in TX-29.\n\nWant to see how much your costs could rise? Use the calculator below. \u2b07\ufe0f \n\n@HouseDemocrats @HouseDPCC",
