                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just 19 days left to extend subsidies to keep health care affordable for millions of Americans, including 111,000 people in my district. It\u2019s time to extend the subsidies and protect what Americans want.\n\nExpect to pay more for health care premiums for less coverage by the end of the month. And on top of that, prices continue to rise. Republicans are in the majority and can\u2019t get one thing right.",
